concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ha a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "317HA Duration of technical assistance request"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-317ha ;
    values:originalText "(1) A technical assistance request:  (a) comes in force:  (i) when it is given; or  (ii) if a later time is specified in the request—at that later time; and  (b) unless sooner revoked, remains in force:  (i) if an expiry date is specified in the request—until the start of the expiry date; or   Industry assistance  Part 15 Voluntary technical assistance  Division 2  Section 317J  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (ii) otherwise—at end of the 90-day period beginning when the request was given.  (2) If a technical assistance request expires, this Part does not prevent the giving of a fresh technical assistance request in the same terms as the expired technical assistance request." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A technical assistance request:  (a) comes in force:  (i) when it is given; or  (ii) if a later time is specified in the request—at that later time; and  (b) unless sooner revoked, remains in force:  (i) if an expiry date is specified in the request—until the start of the expiry date; or   Industry assistance  Part 15 Voluntary technical assistance  Division 2  Section 317J  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (ii) otherwise—at end of the 90-day period beginning when the request was given.  (2) If a technical assistance request expires, this Part does not prevent the giving of a fresh technical assistance request in the same terms as the expired technical assistance request."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3206e454622014348c4c9c79e530666f798db48b435a96feab71db11acf44367" ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ha-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317ha-ss-2 ;
