 was made.  (8) If, under subsection (7):  (a) the Director-General of Security; or  (b) the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence Service; or  (c) the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate; or  (d) the chief officer of an interception agency;" ;
