doc:sec-317ja-ss-8 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "317JA(8) Variation of technical assistance requests" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(8) If, under subsection (7):  (a) the Director-General of Security; or  (b) the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence Service; or  (c) the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate; or  (d) the chief officer of an interception agency;" ;
