doc:sec-317jb-ss-2a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "317JB(2A) Revocation of technical assistance requests" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2A) If a technical assistance request has been given to a person by the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence Service, and the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence Service is satisfied that:  (a) the request is not reasonable and proportionate; or  (b) compliance with the request is not:  (i) practicable; and  (ii) technically feasible; the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence Service must, by written notice given to the person, revoke the request." ;
    cof:pageNumber "68"^^xsd:integer .

