elp  (4) For the purposes of the application of this section to a designated communications provider, if one or more acts or things done by the provider:  (a) are by way of giving help to ASIO or an interception agency; and  (b) are in connection with any or all of the eligible activities of the provider; and" ;
    cof:pageNumber "86"^^xsd:integer .

