doc:sec-317t-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "317T(1) Technical capability notices" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Attorney-General may, in accordance with a request made by the Director-General of Security or the chief officer of an interception agency, give a designated communications provider a written notice, to be known as a technical capability notice, that requires the provider to do one or more specified acts or things that:  (a) are in connection with any or all of the eligible activities of the provider; and  (b) are covered by subsection (2). Note: Section 317ZK deals with the terms and conditions on which such a requirement is to be complied with." ;
    cof:pageNumber "86"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317t-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "317T(2) Technical capability notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-317t-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The specified acts or things must:   Industry assistance  Part 15 Technical capability notices  Division 4  Section 317T  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) be directed towards ensuring that the designated communications provider is capable of giving listed help to ASIO, or an interception agency, in relation to:  (i) the performance of a function, or the exercise of a power, conferred by or under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, so far as the function or power relates to a relevant objective; or  (ii) a matter that facilitates, or is ancillary or incidental to, a matter covered by subparagraph (i); or  (b) be by way of giving help to ASIO, or an interception agency, in relation to:  (i) the performance of a function, or the exercise of a power, conferred by or under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, so far as the function or power relates to a relevant objective; or  (ii) a matter that facilitates, or is ancillary or incidental to, a matter covered by subparagraph (i). Relevant objective" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The specified acts or things must:   Industry assistance  Part 15 Technical capability notices  Division 4  Section 317T  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) be directed towards ensuring that the designated communications provider is capable of giving listed help to ASIO, or an interception agency, in relation to:  (i) the performance of a function, or the exercise of a power, conferred by or under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, so far as the function or power relates to a relevant objective; or  (ii) a matter that facilitates, or is ancillary or incidental to, a matter covered by subparagraph (i); or  (b) be by way of giving help to ASIO, or an interception agency, in relation to:  (i) the performance of a function, or the exercise of a power, conferred by or under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, so far as the function or power relates to a relevant objective; or  (ii) a matter that facilitates, or is ancillary or incidental to, a matter covered by subparagraph (i). Relevant objective"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fb6ec6a3e500555ddce1f4be57dc94891c792dd2b67a9f9e827b206302c8a34c" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317t ;
    cof:pageNumber "86"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The specified acts or things must be directed towards ensuring that the designated communications provider is capable of giving listed help to ASIO, or an interception agency." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
