concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317t-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "317T(4) Technical capability notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-317t-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of the application of this section to a designated communications provider, if one or more acts or things done by the provider:  (a) are by way of giving help to ASIO or an interception agency; and  (b) are in connection with any or all of the eligible activities of the provider; and" ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of the application of this section to a designated communications provider, if one or more acts or things done by the provider:  (a) are by way of giving help to ASIO or an interception agency; and  (b) are in connection with any or all of the eligible activities of the provider; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a4173ff156d5052d0b6c38e05fd3a3741d77a6b53fe93d76d2c831a21effc75f" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317t ;
    cof:pageNumber "86"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Designated communications provider must provide help to ASIO or interception agency in connection with eligible activities." ;
