concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317u a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "317U Compliance period etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-317u ;
    values:originalText "(1) A technical capability notice may require a specified act or thing to be done within a specified period.  (2) A technical capability notice may require a specified act or thing to be done:  (a) in a specified manner; or  (b) in a way that meets one or more specified conditions.  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) of this section do not limit subsections 317T(1) and (2)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A technical capability notice may require a specified act or thing to be done within a specified period.  (2) A technical capability notice may require a specified act or thing to be done:  (a) in a specified manner; or  (b) in a way that meets one or more specified conditions.  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) of this section do not limit subsections 317T(1) and (2)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2dd3f61dd61652dbf0ff567d78d3c85348b5fc123342442413d09bbd2cbc8391" ;
    cof:pageNumber "93"^^xsd:integer ;
