concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317za a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "317ZA Compliance with notices—carriers and carriage service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-317za ;
    values:originalText "providers  (1) A carrier or carriage service provider must comply with a requirement under:  (a) a technical assistance notice; or  (b) a technical capability notice; to the extent that the carrier or provider is capable of doing so.  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1).  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions." ;
    skos:definition "providers  (1) A carrier or carriage service provider must comply with a requirement under:  (a) a technical assistance notice; or  (b) a technical capability notice; to the extent that the carrier or provider is capable of doing so.  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1).  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1e19bab29bc6432a45375515ae332f5fc9540db0100ac0b05c3ccb42923c189d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "112"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317za-ss-1 ;
