concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "317ZC Civil penalty provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-317zc ;
    values:originalText "Enforceable civil penalty provision  (1) Section 317ZB of this Act is enforceable under Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014. Note: Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014 allows a civil penalty provision to be enforced by obtaining an order for a person to pay a pecuniary penalty for the contravention of the provision." ;
    skos:definition "Enforceable civil penalty provision  (1) Section 317ZB of this Act is enforceable under Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014. Note: Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014 allows a civil penalty provision to be enforced by obtaining an order for a person to pay a pecuniary penalty for the contravention of the provision."@en ;
