    values:originalText "Enforceable civil penalty provision  (1) Section 317ZB of this Act is enforceable under Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014. Note: Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014 allows a civil penalty provision to be enforced by obtaining an order for a person to pay a pecuniary penalty for the contravention of the provision." ;
