concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "317ZG(1) Designated communications provider must not be requested"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-317zg-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) a designated communications provider supplies a particular kind of telecommunications service; and  (b) the service involves, or will involve, the use of a telecommunications system; a technical capability notice has no effect to the extent (if any) to which it requires the provider to ensure that the kind of service, or the system:  (c) has the capability to enable a communication passing over the system to be intercepted in accordance with an interception warrant; or  (d) has the capability to transmit lawfully intercepted information to the delivery points applicable in respect of that kind of service; or  (e) has a delivery capability. Note 1:" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) a designated communications provider supplies a particular kind of telecommunications service; and  (b) the service involves, or will involve, the use of a telecommunications system; a technical capability notice has no effect to the extent (if any) to which it requires the provider to ensure that the kind of service, or the system:  (c) has the capability to enable a communication passing over the system to be intercepted in accordance with an interception warrant; or  (d) has the capability to transmit lawfully intercepted information to the delivery points applicable in respect of that kind of service; or  (e) has a delivery capability. Note 1:"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "66d2c6707b0ec3c52effeae72eb31fd83248021818a0bd0b7e6f66eedc7d4ed0" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zg ;
    cof:pageNumber "128"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Designated communications provider must not be requested for certain services. Designated communications provider must not be requested to implement or build a systemic weakness." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.128" ;
