    cof:title "317ZH(3) General limits on technical assistance requests, technical" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A technical assistance request, technical assistance notice or technical capability notice has no effect to the extent (if any) to which it would request or require a designated communications provider to:  (a) use a surveillance device (within the meaning of the Surveillance Devices Act 2004); or  (b) access data held in a computer (within the meaning of the Surveillance Devices Act 2004); if a law of a State or Territory requires a warrant or authorisation for that use or access." ;
    cof:pageNumber "130"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "317ZH(4) General limits on technical assistance requests, technical"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-317zh-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) or (3) does not prevent a technical assistance request, technical assistance notice or technical capability notice from requesting or requiring a designated communications provider to do an act or thing by way of giving help to:  (a) ASIO; or" ;
    skos:definition "(4) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) or (3) does not prevent a technical assistance request, technical assistance notice or technical capability notice from requesting or requiring a designated communications provider to do an act or thing by way of giving help to:  (a) ASIO; or"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d4cde104c8ef7d17411d348a7ba1204cef8a3d11599c6e02d9e82130f6bc0587" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zh ;
    cof:pageNumber "130"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Requesting a designated communications provider to do an act or thing for ASIO." ;
