concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zq a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "317ZQ Delegation by Director-General of the Australian Signals"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-317zq ;
    values:originalText "Directorate  (1) The Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate may, by writing, delegate any or all of the functions or powers of the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate under Division 2 or 6 to a person:  (a) who is a staff member of the Australian Signals Directorate; and  (b) who:  (i) is an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the Australian Signals Directorate; or  (ii) holds, or is acting in, a position in the Australian Signals Directorate that is equivalent to, or higher than, a position occupied by an SES employee.   Industry assistance  Part 15 General provisions  Division 8  Section 317ZR  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) A delegate must comply with any written directions of the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate." ;
    skos:definition "Directorate  (1) The Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate may, by writing, delegate any or all of the functions or powers of the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate under Division 2 or 6 to a person:  (a) who is a staff member of the Australian Signals Directorate; and  (b) who:  (i) is an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the Australian Signals Directorate; or  (ii) holds, or is acting in, a position in the Australian Signals Directorate that is equivalent to, or higher than, a position occupied by an SES employee.   Industry assistance  Part 15 General provisions  Division 8  Section 317ZR  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) A delegate must comply with any written directions of the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "53fcb5a6033042f165e3b7b70528311a083f63b72847aadd9452fbd62db325fc" ;
    cof:pageNumber "150"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zq-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-317zq-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
