concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-333 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "333 Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-333 ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • A carriage service provider may be required to supply a carriage service for defence purposes or for the management of natural disasters. • A carrier or carriage service provider may be required to enter into an agreement with the Commonwealth about:  (a) planning for network survivability; or  (b) operational requirements in times of crisis. • A carrier licence condition or a service provider rule may deal with compliance with a disaster plan." ;
    skos:definition "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • A carriage service provider may be required to supply a carriage service for defence purposes or for the management of natural disasters. • A carrier or carriage service provider may be required to enter into an agreement with the Commonwealth about:  (a) planning for network survivability; or  (b) operational requirements in times of crisis. • A carrier licence condition or a service provider rule may deal with compliance with a disaster plan."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "18f959cb58181cff0f439cbad0ebef7e0f86dd56c85c1e9eefa0d46ba2434a8e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "157"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Carriage service provider may be required to supply a carriage service for defence purposes or natural disasters." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.157" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-333-norm .
