concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-342 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "342 Duration of agreement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-342 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a certified agreement has been entered into, it remains in force until it is revoked under this section.  (2) A certified agreement is revoked if the parties enter into a fresh certified agreement that is expressed to replace the original agreement.  (3) If the ACMA withdraws its certification of a certified agreement, the agreement is revoked 60 days after the withdrawal." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If a certified agreement has been entered into, it remains in force until it is revoked under this section.  (2) A certified agreement is revoked if the parties enter into a fresh certified agreement that is expressed to replace the original agreement.  (3) If the ACMA withdraws its certification of a certified agreement, the agreement is revoked 60 days after the withdrawal."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9fd726ed7df734dcde0f300459f78dedc7329f16550405bdf5e889bd9b2fb91e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "163"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-342-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-342-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-342-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.163" .
