concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-343-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "343(4) Variation of agreement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-343-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If:  (a) a defence authority has prepared a draft variation of a certified agreement; and  (b) the ACMA is of the opinion that, if the agreement, as proposed to be varied, were a draft agreement, the ACMA would certify the agreement; the ACMA must certify the variation." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If:  (a) a defence authority has prepared a draft variation of a certified agreement; and  (b) the ACMA is of the opinion that, if the agreement, as proposed to be varied, were a draft agreement, the ACMA would certify the agreement; the ACMA must certify the variation."@en ;
