ment is in force under subsection (5B)—satisfies the conditions set out in the instrument.  (5B) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, set out conditions for the purposes of paragraph (5A)(b).  (6) Before making a determination under this section, the ACMA must consult the ACCC.  (7) In making a determination under this section, the ACMA may apply, adopt or incorporate (with or without modification) any" ;
