doc:sec-349a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "349A(1) Local access line" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a determination requires a carrier to provide pre-selection in favour of a carriage service provider in relation to calls made using a particular carriage service if, and only if, the determination requires:  (a) the controlled networks and controlled facilities of the carrier to permit an end-user to:  (i) pre-select the carriage service provider as the end-user’s preferred carriage service provider for such of the end-user’s requirements, in relation to calls made using that carriage service, as are specified in the determination; and  (ii) change that selection from time to time; and   Pre-selection in favour of carriage service providers  Part 17  Section 350  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (c) the controlled networks and controlled facilities of the carrier to provide over-ride dial codes for selecting alternative carriage service providers, in relation to calls made using that carriage service, on a call-by-call basis. Note: End-user is defined by subsection (3)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "174"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349a-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "349A(2) Local access line"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-349a-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of this Part, a determination requires a carriage service provider (the first provider) to provide pre-selection in favour of another carriage service provider (the second provider) in relation to calls made using a particular carriage service if, and only if, the determination requires:  (a) the controlled networks and controlled facilities of the first provider to permit an end-user to:  (i) pre-select the second provider as the end-user’s preferred carriage service provider for such of the end-user’s requirements, in relation to calls made using that carriage service, as are specified in the determination; and  (ii) change that selection from time to time; and  (c) the controlled networks and controlled facilities of the first provider to provide over-ride dial codes for selecting alternative carriage service providers, in relation to calls made using that carriage service, on a call-by-call basis. Note: End-user is defined by subsection (3)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) For the purposes of this Part, a determination requires a carriage service provider (the first provider) to provide pre-selection in favour of another carriage service provider (the second provider) in relation to calls made using a particular carriage service if, and only if, the determination requires:  (a) the controlled networks and controlled facilities of the first provider to permit an end-user to:  (i) pre-select the second provider as the end-user’s preferred carriage service provider for such of the end-user’s requirements, in relation to calls made using that carriage service, as are specified in the determination; and  (ii) change that selection from time to time; and  (c) the controlled networks and controlled facilities of the first provider to provide over-ride dial codes for selecting alternative carriage service providers, in relation to calls made using that carriage service, on a call-by-call basis. Note: End-user is defined by subsection (3)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "56d1bab64a06bbbaa987c6fcef2050ad65f9cb841a451100651515a788996ce3" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349a ;
    cof:pageNumber "174"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Carriage service provider must provide pre-selection in favour of another provider. Line does not form part of a local access line to the extent that it is on the customer side of the boundary of a telecommunications network." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.174" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349a-ss-2-norm .
