concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-349a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "349A(4) Local access line"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-349a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Each of the following is an example of an end-user’s requirements:  (a) the end-user’s requirements relating to domestic long-distance calls;  (b) the end-user’s requirements relating to international calls." ;
