    values:originalText "(2) A person must provide pre-selection in accordance with the requirements set out in the determination and on such terms and conditions as are:  (a) agreed between the following parties:  (i) the person;   Pre-selection in favour of carriage service providers  Part 17  Section 352  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (ii) the carriage service provider in whose favour pre-selection is required to be provided; or  (b) failing agreement, determined by an arbitrator appointed by the parties. If the parties fail to agree on the appointment of an arbitrator, the ACCC is to be the arbitrator." ;
