    skos:prefLabel "353(3) Use of over-ride dial codes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-353-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The requirement in subsection (2) does not, by implication, prevent an alternative carriage service provider from refusing to supply a carriage service to the end-user concerned." ;
