concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360ac a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360AC Control"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-360ac ;
    values:originalText "In this Part, control includes control as a result of, or by means of, trusts, agreements, arrangements, understandings and practices, whether or not having legal or equitable force and whether or not based on legal or equitable rights." ;
