doc:sec-360k-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "360K(1) Statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service area" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:  (a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a declaration made by a carrier under section 360H; and  (b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area is a nominated service area; the carrier is the statutory infrastructure provider for the nominated service area. Nominated service area covered by a declaration under section 360HB" ;
