    skos:definition "(1A) For the purposes of this Part, if:  (a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a declaration made by a carriage service provider under section 360HB; and  (b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area is a nominated service area; the carriage service provider is the statutory infrastructure provider for the nominated service area."@en ;
