    cof:title "360L(2) Designated service area and statutory infrastructure provider" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:  (a) a specified area is a designated service area for the purposes of this Part; and  (b) each of 2 or more specified persons is a statutory infrastructure provider for the designated service area for the purposes of this Part. Note 1: For variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901. Note 2: For the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA." ;
