doc:sec-360la-ss-2a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "360LA(2A) Format of description of areas" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2A) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument, determine a coordinate system for the purposes of paragraphs (1)(g) and (2)(e). Note: For variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
