concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360la-ss-2b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360LA(2B) Format of description of areas"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-360la-ss-2b ;
    values:originalText "(2B) If a coordinate system is determined under subsection (2A), the determination does not apply to a declaration made, or a notice given, before the commencement of the determination." ;
