concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360P(8) Obligation of statutory infrastructure provider to connect"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-360p-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) If:  (a) a carriage service provider makes a request as mentioned in subsection (1) in relation to the connection of premises in a service area; and  (b) as a result, the statutory infrastructure provider has an obligation under subsection (1) to connect the premises; and  (c) the statutory infrastructure provider has made available on its website:  (i) the terms and conditions relating to price or a method of ascertaining price; and" ;
    skos:definition "(8) If:  (a) a carriage service provider makes a request as mentioned in subsection (1) in relation to the connection of premises in a service area; and  (b) as a result, the statutory infrastructure provider has an obligation under subsection (1) to connect the premises; and  (c) the statutory infrastructure provider has made available on its website:  (i) the terms and conditions relating to price or a method of ascertaining price; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "26f4a49fb36c1abdea3cbe7540da05c7282c6079cbaa7823678800930044f59f" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360p ;
    cof:pageNumber "224"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Statutory infrastructure provider must connect premises upon request." ;
    dc:description "Connection to premises" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
