concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360VD(4) Damages for breach of a designated compensable standard"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-360vd-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, if:  (a) the statutory infrastructure provider:   Statutory infrastructure providers  Part 19 Compensation  Division 4A  Section 360VD  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (i) credits an amount to an account that the customer has with the provider; or  (ii) pays an amount to the customer; and  (b) the credit or payment was made as a result of a right or remedy that:  (i) was available to the customer otherwise than under this Division; and  (ii) arose out of the same event or transaction as the contravention; the amount of damages payable for the contravention is to be reduced (but not below zero) by the amount of the credit or payment." ;
    skos:definition "(4) However, if:  (a) the statutory infrastructure provider:   Statutory infrastructure providers  Part 19 Compensation  Division 4A  Section 360VD  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (i) credits an amount to an account that the customer has with the provider; or  (ii) pays an amount to the customer; and  (b) the credit or payment was made as a result of a right or remedy that:  (i) was available to the customer otherwise than under this Division; and  (ii) arose out of the same event or transaction as the contravention; the amount of damages payable for the contravention is to be reduced (but not below zero) by the amount of the credit or payment."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "94d60e09ffc6a9cb7659e675ec117c3bac0eac49c1dfc77d1be02c03ed85b0a1" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd ;
    cof:pageNumber "246"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Reduction of damages for breach of standard" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
