concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360vd-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360VD(5) Damages for breach of a designated compensable standard"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-360vd-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The customer may recover the amount of the damages by action against the statutory infrastructure provider in a court of competent jurisdiction." ;
