concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360za-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360ZA(3) Delegation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-360za-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The ACMA may, by writing, delegate to:  (a) a member of the ACMA; or  (b) a person who is:  (i) a member of the staff of the ACMA; and  (ii) an SES employee or acting SES employee; or  (c) a person who:  (i) is a member of the staff of the ACMA; and  (ii) holds, or is acting in, an Executive Level 1 or 2, or equivalent, position; any or all of the powers that have been delegated by the Minister to the ACMA under subsection (1)." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The ACMA may, by writing, delegate to:  (a) a member of the ACMA; or  (b) a person who is:  (i) a member of the staff of the ACMA; and  (ii) an SES employee or acting SES employee; or  (c) a person who:  (i) is a member of the staff of the ACMA; and  (ii) holds, or is acting in, an Executive Level 1 or 2, or equivalent, position; any or all of the powers that have been delegated by the Minister to the ACMA under subsection (1)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1a59dce33ce310452c23312a9b0fcd988518517b1827878139950004495145b5" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-360za ;
    cof:pageNumber "262"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Delegation of powers to ACMA staff and SES employees" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
