    cof:title "365(3) INTELSAT and Inmarsat—directions to Signatories" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Minister must not give a direction under subsection (2) that relates to the manner in which the person is to deal with a particular customer." ;
    cof:pageNumber "266"^^xsd:integer .

