concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "372 Reviews of the operation of this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-372 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACCC must review, and report each financial year to the Minister on, the operation of this Division.  (2) The ACCC must give a report under subsection (1) to the Minister as soon as practicable after the end of the financial year concerned.  (3) The ACCC must, if directed in writing to do so by the Minister, review, and report to the Minister on, specified matters relating to the operation of this Division.  (4) The ACCC must give a report under subsection (3) to the Minister before the end of the period specified in the direction.  (5) The Minister must cause a copy of a report under this section to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after receiving the report.   Deployment of optical fibre etc.  Part 20A Simplified outline  Division 1  Section 372A  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACCC must review, and report each financial year to the Minister on, the operation of this Division.  (2) The ACCC must give a report under subsection (1) to the Minister as soon as practicable after the end of the financial year concerned.  (3) The ACCC must, if directed in writing to do so by the Minister, review, and report to the Minister on, specified matters relating to the operation of this Division.  (4) The ACCC must give a report under subsection (3) to the Minister before the end of the period specified in the direction.  (5) The Minister must cause a copy of a report under this section to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after receiving the report.   Deployment of optical fibre etc.  Part 20A Simplified outline  Division 1  Section 372A  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fca5a4a6bd8c224e128882fb04d6e6c4d1a0457b6d6b10b5b6f629e6fc95cef3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "272"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372-ss-4 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372-ss-5 ;
