doc:sec-372h-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "372H(3) Sale of building units—other projects" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If such a building unit is in a Territory, a person (other than a constitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out, or carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit unless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to the unit. Note 1: For functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W. Note 2: For proximity, see section 372Y. Note 3: For exemptions, see section 372K." ;
    cof:pageNumber "286"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h-ss-3a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "372H(3A) Sale of building units—other projects"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-372h-ss-3a ;
    values:originalText "(3A) If such a building unit is in a State, a person (other than a constitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out, or carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit unless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to the unit. Note 1: For functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W. Note 2: For proximity, see section 372Y. Note 3: For exemptions, see section 372K. Ancillary contraventions" ;
    skos:definition "(3A) If such a building unit is in a State, a person (other than a constitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out, or carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit unless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to the unit. Note 1: For functional fibre-ready facility, see section 372W. Note 2: For proximity, see section 372Y. Note 3: For exemptions, see section 372K. Ancillary contraventions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f1845b2cf389410f193ca4e1264bb3bae2db66e730256bad8430425192396a66" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372h ;
    cof:pageNumber "286"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No sale or lease of a building unit without a functional fibre-ready facility installed nearby." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
