concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372jc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "372JC Compliance with remedial notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-372jc ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person must comply with a remedial notice. Ancillary contraventions  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1). Civil penalty provisions  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person must comply with a remedial notice. Ancillary contraventions  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1). Civil penalty provisions  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "49ef787dabb839a39fae707bd6c5afd257bec26e52f9015f4a855da2a820105c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "290"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372jc-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372jc-ss-2 ;
