concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372je a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "372JE Variation of remedial notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-372je ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This section applies if a person has been given a remedial notice. Variation  (2) The ACMA may, by written notice given to the person, vary the notice.  (3) The ACMA may also, in accordance with section 372JD, extend the compliance period for a remedial notice." ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This section applies if a person has been given a remedial notice. Variation  (2) The ACMA may, by written notice given to the person, vary the notice.  (3) The ACMA may also, in accordance with section 372JD, extend the compliance period for a remedial notice."@en ;
