concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372na-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "372NA(6) Code relating to access"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-372na-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (2); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (2); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (2); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (2). Civil penalty provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(6) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (2); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (2); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (2); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (2). Civil penalty provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "75bf448aa9a58408168755fc294ce90421610d751a946de60011c7f8b581e94b" ;
