concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372y a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "372Y Installation of a fibre-ready facility in proximity to a building"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-372y ;
    values:originalText "lot or building unit Building lot  (1) For the purposes of this Part, a fibre-ready facility used, or for use, in connection with a line is installed in proximity to a building lot if, and only if, it is installed:  (a) in, on or under the lot, so as to enable the line to be readily connected to a building unit that has been, is being, is to be, or may be, constructed on the lot; or  (b) in sufficient proximity to the lot as to enable the line to be readily connected to a building unit that has been, is being, is to be, or may be, constructed on the lot. Building unit  (2) For the purposes of this Part, a fibre-ready facility used, or for use, in connection with a line is installed in proximity to a building unit if, and only if, it is installed in sufficient proximity to the building unit as to enable the line to be readily connected to the building unit." ;
    skos:definition "lot or building unit Building lot  (1) For the purposes of this Part, a fibre-ready facility used, or for use, in connection with a line is installed in proximity to a building lot if, and only if, it is installed:  (a) in, on or under the lot, so as to enable the line to be readily connected to a building unit that has been, is being, is to be, or may be, constructed on the lot; or  (b) in sufficient proximity to the lot as to enable the line to be readily connected to a building unit that has been, is being, is to be, or may be, constructed on the lot. Building unit  (2) For the purposes of this Part, a fibre-ready facility used, or for use, in connection with a line is installed in proximity to a building unit if, and only if, it is installed in sufficient proximity to the building unit as to enable the line to be readily connected to the building unit."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "94991187abd47ef16d30dc427fd61e6a31960efd25cb96b4ac1fd230104e9d88" ;
    cof:pageNumber "306"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372y-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372y-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
