concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-372zd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "372ZD NBN Co"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-372zd ;
    values:originalText "In this Part:   Deployment of optical fibre etc.  Part 20A Miscellaneous  Division 6  Section 372ZD  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  NBN Co means NBN Co Limited (ACN 136 533 741), as the company exists from time to time (even if its name is later changed)." ;
