concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-378 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "378 Procedures for making technical standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-378 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Before making a technical standard under section 376, the ACMA must, so far as is practicable, try to ensure that:  (a) interested persons have had an adequate opportunity to make representations about the proposed standard (either directly, or indirectly by means of a report under paragraph (2)(g)); and  (b) due consideration has been given to any representation so made." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Before making a technical standard under section 376, the ACMA must, so far as is practicable, try to ensure that:  (a) interested persons have had an adequate opportunity to make representations about the proposed standard (either directly, or indirectly by means of a report under paragraph (2)(g)); and  (b) due consideration has been given to any representation so made."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ca581f1da1eaa03e4a2b47937507920e9f9691b0e1ec095150957ed87d5b6f38" ;
    cof:pageNumber "315"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Ensure adequate opportunity for representation and due consideration of representations." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.315" ;
