concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-387 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "387 Procedures for making technical standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-387 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACMA must not make a standard under section 384 relating to a particular matter unless:  (a) the ACMA has given a body or association a written notice requesting the body or association to make a standard relating to that matter within the period specified in the notice; and  (b) one of the following subparagraphs applies:  (i) the body or association does not comply with the request;  (ii) the body or association complies with the request, but the ACMA is not satisfied that the body’s or association’s standard deals with that matter in an adequate way;  (iii) the body or association complies with the request, but the ACMA is not satisfied that the body’s or association’s standard is operating adequately.  (2) The period specified under paragraph (1)(a) must run for at least 120 days after the notice was given." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACMA must not make a standard under section 384 relating to a particular matter unless:  (a) the ACMA has given a body or association a written notice requesting the body or association to make a standard relating to that matter within the period specified in the notice; and  (b) one of the following subparagraphs applies:  (i) the body or association does not comply with the request;  (ii) the body or association complies with the request, but the ACMA is not satisfied that the body’s or association’s standard deals with that matter in an adequate way;  (iii) the body or association complies with the request, but the ACMA is not satisfied that the body’s or association’s standard is operating adequately.  (2) The period specified under paragraph (1)(a) must run for at least 120 days after the notice was given."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c56d24def596d8545be30acb192b305696309b1ea295ca6243a365300635a080" ;
    cof:pageNumber "323"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-387-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-387-ss-2 ;
