concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-390 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "390 Application for connection permit"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-390 ;
    values:originalText "Customer equipment  (1) A person (the applicant) may apply to the ACMA for a permit authorising the applicant, and such other persons as are from time to time nominated by the applicant, to:  (a) connect specified customer equipment to a telecommunications network or to a facility; and  (b) maintain such a connection. The permit is called a connection permit. Customer cabling  (2) A person (the applicant) may apply to the ACMA for a permit authorising the applicant, and such other persons as are from time to time nominated by the applicant, to:  (a) connect specified customer cabling to a telecommunications network or to a facility; and  (b) maintain such a connection. The permit is called a connection permit." ;
    skos:definition "Customer equipment  (1) A person (the applicant) may apply to the ACMA for a permit authorising the applicant, and such other persons as are from time to time nominated by the applicant, to:  (a) connect specified customer equipment to a telecommunications network or to a facility; and  (b) maintain such a connection. The permit is called a connection permit. Customer cabling  (2) A person (the applicant) may apply to the ACMA for a permit authorising the applicant, and such other persons as are from time to time nominated by the applicant, to:  (a) connect specified customer cabling to a telecommunications network or to a facility; and  (b) maintain such a connection. The permit is called a connection permit."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6d6dd7bcbb3a484e9dbb4b85cea467a73a579656b5591e39ef01a87bbc42a928" ;
    cof:pageNumber "327"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-390-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-390-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.327" .
