    values:originalText "(2) A person (the applicant) may apply to the ACMA for a permit authorising the applicant, and such other persons as are from time to time nominated by the applicant, to:  (a) connect specified customer cabling to a telecommunications network or to a facility; and  (b) maintain such a connection. The permit is called a connection permit." ;
    cof:pageNumber "327"^^xsd:integer .

