    skos:prefLabel "394(4) Issue of connection permits"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-394-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Subsections (2) and (3) do not, by implication, limit the matters to which the ACMA may have regard." ;
