concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-399-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "399(2) Offence of contravening condition"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-399-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) In this section: engage in conduct means:  (a) do an act; or  (b) omit to perform an act." ;
    skos:definition "(2) In this section: engage in conduct means:  (a) do an act; or  (b) omit to perform an act."@en ;
