concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-402 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "402 Cancellation of connection permit"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-402 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACMA may, by written notice given to the holder of a connection permit, cancel the permit.  (2) In deciding whether to cancel the permit, the ACMA may have regard to any matter which the ACMA was entitled, under subsection 394(2), to have regard in deciding whether to issue a permit." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACMA may, by written notice given to the holder of a connection permit, cancel the permit.  (2) In deciding whether to cancel the permit, the ACMA may have regard to any matter which the ACMA was entitled, under subsection 394(2), to have regard in deciding whether to issue a permit."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "469245a54f6d1507b4b934329e02b25f7de356ff2b20297cef47843c37217fa0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "331"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-402-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-402-ss-2 ;
