concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-409 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "409 Recognised testing authorities and competent bodies"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-409 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACMA may, by notice published in the Gazette, determine that a specified person or association is an accreditation body for the purposes of this section. The determination has effect accordingly.  (2) An accreditation body may, by written instrument, determine that a specified person is a recognised testing authority for the purposes of this Division. The determination has effect accordingly.  (3) An accreditation body may, by written instrument, determine that a specified person or association is a competent body for the purposes of this Division. The determination has effect accordingly." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACMA may, by notice published in the Gazette, determine that a specified person or association is an accreditation body for the purposes of this section. The determination has effect accordingly.  (2) An accreditation body may, by written instrument, determine that a specified person is a recognised testing authority for the purposes of this Division. The determination has effect accordingly.  (3) An accreditation body may, by written instrument, determine that a specified person or association is a competent body for the purposes of this Division. The determination has effect accordingly."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "87b1d023b834cfee56d5879cbfdb5f71a90698c5074f2c717b1e523277aced33" ;
    cof:pageNumber "338"^^xsd:integer ;
