doc:sec-411-ss-2a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "411(2A) Connection of customer equipment or customer cabling—" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2A) Subsection (2) does not apply if the person has a reasonable excuse. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in subsection (2A) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code). Exception—connection permit" ;
    cof:pageNumber "338"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-411-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "411(3) Connection of customer equipment or customer cabling—"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-411-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person does not contravene subsection (1) in relation to:  (a) connecting customer equipment, or customer cabling, to a telecommunications network, or to a facility; or  (b) maintaining such a connection; if the connection, or the maintenance of the connection, as the case may be, is in accordance with a connection permit. Note: Connection permits are issued under section 394." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A person does not contravene subsection (1) in relation to:  (a) connecting customer equipment, or customer cabling, to a telecommunications network, or to a facility; or  (b) maintaining such a connection; if the connection, or the maintenance of the connection, as the case may be, is in accordance with a connection permit. Note: Connection permits are issued under section 394."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "749c33e337ea4cd2f84476a0e0f3703c7ff277afbbe6c2a2390054ea94c40140" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-411 ;
    cof:pageNumber "338"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Permit required for connection or maintenance of customer equipment or cabling." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
