    skos:prefLabel "414(2) Applying labels before satisfying requirements under"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-414-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is a manufacturer or importer of customer equipment or customer cabling; and  (b) the person engages in conduct; and  (c) the person’s conduct contravenes a requirement referred to in subsection (1). Penalty: 100 penalty units. Note 1: See also sections 4AA and 4B of the Crimes Act 1914. Note 2: See also Division 13 of this Part (which deals with the payment of penalties as an alternative to prosecution)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is a manufacturer or importer of customer equipment or customer cabling; and  (b) the person engages in conduct; and  (c) the person’s conduct contravenes a requirement referred to in subsection (1). Penalty: 100 penalty units. Note 1: See also sections 4AA and 4B of the Crimes Act 1914. Note 2: See also Division 13 of this Part (which deals with the payment of penalties as an alternative to prosecution)."@en ;
