concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-16-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16(9) August 1996, the person:"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-16-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) For the purposes of this Part, if:  (a) a label is applied to customer equipment or customer cabling; and  (b) the label embodies a symbol referred to in paragraph (8)(a) or (b); the label is taken to indicate that the equipment or cabling meets the requirements of each applicable section 376 standard." ;
    skos:definition "(9) For the purposes of this Part, if:  (a) a label is applied to customer equipment or customer cabling; and  (b) the label embodies a symbol referred to in paragraph (8)(a) or (b); the label is taken to indicate that the equipment or cabling meets the requirements of each applicable section 376 standard."@en ;
