concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-419 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "419 Types of cabling work"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-419 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument, declare that a specified kind of cabling work is a type of cabling work for the purposes of this Division.  (2) The declaration has effect accordingly.  (3) For the purposes of this Division, the type of cabling work is to be ascertained solely by reference to the declaration." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument, declare that a specified kind of cabling work is a type of cabling work for the purposes of this Division.  (2) The declaration has effect accordingly.  (3) For the purposes of this Division, the type of cabling work is to be ascertained solely by reference to the declaration."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bd75c326214907a39c8a5f55c30633e3773c3933658b9c22e5f1ddec3f72cacb" ;
