    cof:title "427 Grant of cabling licence" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) After considering an application, the ACMA may grant a cabling licence in accordance with the application.   Technical regulation  Part 21 Cabling providers  Division 9  Section 428  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) The ACMA must not grant a cabling licence authorising the performance of a particular type of cabling work unless it is satisfied that:  (a) the applicant has the necessary knowledge and experience to perform cabling work of that type; and  (b) cabling work of that type performed in accordance with the conditions included in the licence would comply with standards in force under section 376; and  (c) the issue of the licence is not contrary to directions given by the Minister under section 440." ;
    cof:pageNumber "352"^^xsd:integer .

