doc:sec-442-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "442(4) Register of cabling licences" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of this section, if the Register is maintained by electronic means, a person is taken to have made a copy of, or taken an extract from, the Register if the ACMA gives the person a printout of, or of the relevant parts of, the Register." ;
    cof:pageNumber "360"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-442-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "442(5) Register of cabling licences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-442-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If a person requests that a copy be provided in an electronic form, the ACMA may provide the relevant information:  (a) on a data processing device; or  (b) by way of electronic transmission.   Technical regulation  Part 21 Remedies for unauthorised connections to telecommunications networks etc.  Division  Section 443  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(5) If a person requests that a copy be provided in an electronic form, the ACMA may provide the relevant information:  (a) on a data processing device; or  (b) by way of electronic transmission.   Technical regulation  Part 21 Remedies for unauthorised connections to telecommunications networks etc.  Division  Section 443  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1fe7a7567a13153511e4fcf2a32440457585a02d4d09ef638de897ad3479e899" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-442 ;
