doc:sec-447-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "447(2) Disconnection of customer equipment or customer cabling—" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If:  (a) equipment or cabling is disconnected, or purportedly disconnected, under subsection (1); and  (b) the ACMA is satisfied that there were no reasonable grounds for the belief mentioned in paragraph (1)(b); the ACMA may, by written notice given to the manager of the network or facility, direct the manager to reconnect the equipment or cabling." ;
    cof:pageNumber "367"^^xsd:integer .

