concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-453a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "453A Penalties payable instead of prosecution"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-453a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The regulations may make provision in relation to enabling a person who is alleged to have committed an offence of a kind referred to in the following table to pay to the Commonwealth, as an alternative to prosecution, a penalty of an amount worked out in accordance with subsection (2).  (2) The amount of penalty payable to the Commonwealth under regulations made for the purposes of subsection (1) in respect of an offence is determined using the following table:  Penalties payable  Item Alleged offence Penalty for individual Penalty for body corporate subsection 399(1) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 411(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 413(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 414(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 415(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 416(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 417(2) 6 penalty units 30 penalty units subsection 420(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 421(4) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 434(1) or (2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The regulations may make provision in relation to enabling a person who is alleged to have committed an offence of a kind referred to in the following table to pay to the Commonwealth, as an alternative to prosecution, a penalty of an amount worked out in accordance with subsection (2).  (2) The amount of penalty payable to the Commonwealth under regulations made for the purposes of subsection (1) in respect of an offence is determined using the following table:  Penalties payable  Item Alleged offence Penalty for individual Penalty for body corporate subsection 399(1) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 411(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 413(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 414(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 415(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 416(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 417(2) 6 penalty units 30 penalty units subsection 420(2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 421(4) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units subsection 434(1) or (2) 12 penalty units 60 penalty units"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "78e3680e987f789db4f369a77eec6df0a114ef98de969de97c2fe56006110739" ;
    cof:pageNumber "373"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-453a-ss-1 ;
