concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-461a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "461A Making numbering plan in cases of urgency"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-461a ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if the ACMA is satisfied that it is necessary to make or vary a numbering plan as a matter of urgency to ensure that numbering of carriage services and the use of numbers are properly managed in the absence of a numbering scheme manager.  (2) In the circumstances described in subsection (1):" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if the ACMA is satisfied that it is necessary to make or vary a numbering plan as a matter of urgency to ensure that numbering of carriage services and the use of numbers are properly managed in the absence of a numbering scheme manager.  (2) In the circumstances described in subsection (1):"@en ;
