    values:originalText "(3) The regulations may make provision for and in relation to the conduct of an arbitration under this section.   Numbering of carriage services and regulation of electronic addressing  Part 22 Numbering of carriage services  Division 2  Section 463A  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
