concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-473 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "473 Letters and symbols taken to be numbers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-473 ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Division, a letter or a symbol is taken to be a number.   Numbering of carriage services and regulation of electronic addressing  Part 22 Regulation of electronic addressing  Division 3  Section 474  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "For the purposes of this Division, a letter or a symbol is taken to be a number.   Numbering of carriage services and regulation of electronic addressing  Part 22 Regulation of electronic addressing  Division 3  Section 474  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
