concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-474-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "474(3) Declared manager of electronic addressing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-474-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The ACMA must not make a determination under subsection (1) in relation to a particular person or association unless:  (a) the ACMA is directed to do so by the ACCC under subsection (4); or  (b) the ACMA considers that the person or association is not managing that kind of electronic addressing to the ACMA’s satisfaction." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The ACMA must not make a determination under subsection (1) in relation to a particular person or association unless:  (a) the ACMA is directed to do so by the ACCC under subsection (4); or  (b) the ACMA considers that the person or association is not managing that kind of electronic addressing to the ACMA’s satisfaction."@en ;
