concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-474-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "474(6) Declared manager of electronic addressing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-474-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) The ACCC must not give a direction under subsection (4) unless, in the ACCC’s opinion, compliance with the direction is likely to have a bearing on competition or consumer protection." ;
