    cof:title "484J(2) Automation of administrative action" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Administrative action is:  (a) making a decision under subsection 484F(5) or (6); or  (b) making a decision under subsection 484G(4), (6) or (7); or  (c) giving a notice under subsection 484F(8) or 484G(8); or  (d) doing, or refusing or failing to do, anything related to making a decision under subsection 484F(5) or (6) or 484G(4), (6) or (7). The ACMA is treated as having taken administrative action" ;
    cof:pageNumber "414"^^xsd:integer .

