concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-484j-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "484J(5) Automation of administrative action"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-484j-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The substituted decision takes effect on:  (a) if the ACMA specifies the day on which the substituted decision takes effect (which may be earlier than the day the substituted decision is made)—that specified day; or  (b) otherwise—the day of the decision taken by the operation of the computer program.   SMS Sender ID Register  Part 24B  Section 484K  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Arrangement not a legislative instrument" ;
    skos:definition "(5) The substituted decision takes effect on:  (a) if the ACMA specifies the day on which the substituted decision takes effect (which may be earlier than the day the substituted decision is made)—that specified day; or  (b) otherwise—the day of the decision taken by the operation of the computer program.   SMS Sender ID Register  Part 24B  Section 484K  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Arrangement not a legislative instrument"@en ;
