concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-493-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "493(5) Confidential material not to be published"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-493-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsections (3) and (4) do not apply if the person has a reasonable excuse. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in subsection (5) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)." ;
    skos:definition "(5) Subsections (3) and (4) do not apply if the person has a reasonable excuse. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in subsection (5) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)."@en ;
