concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-494-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "494(6) Direction about private hearings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-494-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Subsections (3), (4) and (5) do not apply if the person has a reasonable excuse. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in subsection (6) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)." ;
    skos:definition "(6) Subsections (3), (4) and (5) do not apply if the person has a reasonable excuse. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in subsection (6) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)."@en ;
