concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-495-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "495(4) Reports on inquiries"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-495-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The ACMA is not required to include in a report any material:  (a) that is of a confidential nature; or  (b) the disclosure of which is likely to prejudice the fair trial of a person; or  (c) that is the subject of an order or direction under section 493 or 494.   Public inquiries  Part 25 Inquiries by the ACCC  Division 3  Section 496  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(4) The ACMA is not required to include in a report any material:  (a) that is of a confidential nature; or  (b) the disclosure of which is likely to prejudice the fair trial of a person; or  (c) that is the subject of an order or direction under section 493 or 494.   Public inquiries  Part 25 Inquiries by the ACCC  Division 3  Section 496  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "09c90930a78f4e5dfaceabcd288c1dd110f2d8be544a2623ed6991aebc6d5b23" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-495 ;
    cof:pageNumber "426"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemptions from reporting confidential material" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
