concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "505 Reports on inquiries"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-505 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the ACCC holds a public inquiry, the ACCC must prepare a report setting out its findings as a result of the inquiry.  (2) If the inquiry was held because of a direction given by the Minister under section 496, the ACCC must give a copy of the report to the Minister.  (3) If the inquiry was held otherwise than because of a direction given by the Minister under section 496, the ACCC must publish the report.  (4) The ACCC is not required to include in a report any material:   Public inquiries  Part 25 Inquiries by the ACCC  Division 3  Section 505A  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) that is of a confidential nature; or  (b) the disclosure of which is likely to prejudice the fair trial of a person; or  (c) that is the subject of an order or direction under section 503 or 504." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the ACCC holds a public inquiry, the ACCC must prepare a report setting out its findings as a result of the inquiry.  (2) If the inquiry was held because of a direction given by the Minister under section 496, the ACCC must give a copy of the report to the Minister.  (3) If the inquiry was held otherwise than because of a direction given by the Minister under section 496, the ACCC must publish the report.  (4) The ACCC is not required to include in a report any material:   Public inquiries  Part 25 Inquiries by the ACCC  Division 3  Section 505A  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) that is of a confidential nature; or  (b) the disclosure of which is likely to prejudice the fair trial of a person; or  (c) that is the subject of an order or direction under section 503 or 504."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "02405c45fb6729e6f7a8b4aa5c1bebd86db3493b1f1cf665f2b96f336b51a5f9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "432"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-505-ss-4 ;
