concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "547B Monitoring powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-547b ;
    values:originalText "(1) The monitoring powers that an inspector may exercise under paragraph 547A(1)(b) are as follows:  (a) to search the premises;  (b) to inspect and take photographs, or make sketches, of the premises or any substance or thing at the premises;  (c) to inspect any document kept at the premises;  (d) to remove, or make copies of, any such document;  (e) to take onto the premises such equipment and materials as the inspector requires for the purpose of exercising powers in relation to the premises;" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The monitoring powers that an inspector may exercise under paragraph 547A(1)(b) are as follows:  (a) to search the premises;  (b) to inspect and take photographs, or make sketches, of the premises or any substance or thing at the premises;  (c) to inspect any document kept at the premises;  (d) to remove, or make copies of, any such document;  (e) to take onto the premises such equipment and materials as the inspector requires for the purpose of exercising powers in relation to the premises;"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7bf8b584fe78723d06d15179ec876a9d19147e1027916bfbc7d4bcaa7ceb02e9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "471"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Inspector's powers to search and inspect premises" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
