doc:sec-547b a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "547B Monitoring powers" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The monitoring powers that an inspector may exercise under paragraph 547A(1)(b) are as follows:  (a) to search the premises;  (b) to inspect and take photographs, or make sketches, of the premises or any substance or thing at the premises;  (c) to inspect any document kept at the premises;  (d) to remove, or make copies of, any such document;  (e) to take onto the premises such equipment and materials as the inspector requires for the purpose of exercising powers in relation to the premises;" ;
    cof:pageNumber "471"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547d a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "547D Monitoring warrants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-547d ;
    values:originalText "(1) An inspector may apply to a magistrate for a warrant under this section in relation to premises.  (2) The magistrate may issue the warrant if the magistrate is satisfied, by information on oath or affirmation, that it is reasonably necessary that one or more inspectors should have access to the premises for the purposes of finding out whether the Spam Act 2003 has been complied with.  (3) The magistrate must not issue the warrant unless the inspector or some other person has given to the magistrate, either orally or by affidavit, such further information (if any) as the magistrate" ;
    skos:definition "(1) An inspector may apply to a magistrate for a warrant under this section in relation to premises.  (2) The magistrate may issue the warrant if the magistrate is satisfied, by information on oath or affirmation, that it is reasonably necessary that one or more inspectors should have access to the premises for the purposes of finding out whether the Spam Act 2003 has been complied with.  (3) The magistrate must not issue the warrant unless the inspector or some other person has given to the magistrate, either orally or by affidavit, such further information (if any) as the magistrate"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "804577b74911c0c4c935d0d1eea4735e125efa2983e170607097316bc7abb24a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "473"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547d-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547d-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547d-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.473" .
