concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "547H Occupier entitled to be present during search"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-547h ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) a warrant under section 547D in relation to premises is being executed; and  (b) the occupier of the premises, or another person who apparently represents the occupier, is present at the premises;   Enforcement  Part 28 Searches to monitor compliance with the Spam Act 2003  Division 5A  Section 547H  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  the person is entitled to observe the search being conducted.  (2) The right to observe the search being conducted ceases if the person impedes the search.  (3) This section does not prevent 2 or more areas of the premises being searched at the same time." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) a warrant under section 547D in relation to premises is being executed; and  (b) the occupier of the premises, or another person who apparently represents the occupier, is present at the premises;   Enforcement  Part 28 Searches to monitor compliance with the Spam Act 2003  Division 5A  Section 547H  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  the person is entitled to observe the search being conducted.  (2) The right to observe the search being conducted ceases if the person impedes the search.  (3) This section does not prevent 2 or more areas of the premises being searched at the same time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fbff1effb5e1f276c27bb3bf83869697a5a154e7379e9c69e1612dd384a2a8fd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "476"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-547h-ss-1 ;
