concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-554 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "554 Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-554 ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • Certain decisions of the ACMA may be reviewed by the Administrative Review Tribunal following a process of internal reconsideration by the ACMA." ;
