on 152AZ of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (vii) the service provider rule set out in subsection 152BA(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (viii) the carrier licence condition set out in section 152BCO of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (ix) the service provider rule set out in subsection 152BCP(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (x) the carrier licence condition set out in section 152BDF of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (xi) the service provider rule set out in subsection 152BDG(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (xii) the carrier licence condition set out in section 152BEC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (xiii) the service provider rule set out in subsection 152BED(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (xiv) the carrier licence condition set out in section 152CJC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or" ;
