    skos:definition "(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(a), the Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination that:  (a) sets out one or more kinds of contraventions of section 68 or 101; and  (b) for each kind of contravention set out in the determination, specifies a particular number of penalty units."@en ;
