doc:sec-572l-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "572L(2) Appointment of authorised infringement notice officer" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The ACMA must not appoint a person under subsection (1) unless the person:  (a) is an SES employee or acting SES employee; or  (b) holds, or is acting in, an Executive Level 1 or 2 position or an equivalent position. Note: SES employee is defined in the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    cof:pageNumber "512"^^xsd:integer .

