concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572l-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "572L(5) Appointment of authorised infringement notice officer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-572l-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) An authorised infringement notice officer appointed under subsection (1) must not give or withdraw an infringement notice if the alleged contravention consists of a breach of:   Infringement notices for contraventions of civil penalty provisions  Part 31B  Section 572M  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) section 68, to the extent to which that section relates to the carrier licence condition set out in Part 1 of Schedule 1 in so far as that condition relates to section 142C, 143, 143B, 151ZA, 151ZB, 151ZD, 151ZF, 151ZG, 151ZH or 151ZI; or  (b) section 101, to the extent to which that section relates to the service provider rule set out in Part 1 of Schedule 2 in so far as that rule relates to section 142C, 143, 143B, 151ZA, 151ZB, 151ZD, 151ZF, 151ZG, 151ZH or 151ZI; or  (c) section 142C, 143, 143B, 151ZA, 151ZB, 151ZD, 151ZF, 151ZG, 151ZH or 151ZI." ;
    skos:definition "(5) An authorised infringement notice officer appointed under subsection (1) must not give or withdraw an infringement notice if the alleged contravention consists of a breach of:   Infringement notices for contraventions of civil penalty provisions  Part 31B  Section 572M  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) section 68, to the extent to which that section relates to the carrier licence condition set out in Part 1 of Schedule 1 in so far as that condition relates to section 142C, 143, 143B, 151ZA, 151ZB, 151ZD, 151ZF, 151ZG, 151ZH or 151ZI; or  (b) section 101, to the extent to which that section relates to the service provider rule set out in Part 1 of Schedule 2 in so far as that rule relates to section 142C, 143, 143B, 151ZA, 151ZB, 151ZD, 151ZF, 151ZG, 151ZH or 151ZI; or  (c) section 142C, 143, 143B, 151ZA, 151ZB, 151ZD, 151ZF, 151ZG, 151ZH or 151ZI."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e844be7f76cea394baff5aad645ad8c9de7600976fe3bd7ac3bedce9916506fe" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572l ;
    cof:pageNumber "512"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Authorized infringement notice officer must not issue or withdraw an infringement notice for certain contraventions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
