concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572m a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "572M Guidelines relating to infringement notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-572m ;
    values:originalText "ACMA guidelines  (1) If an authorised infringement notice officer is the Chair of the ACMA, or a member of the staff of the ACMA appointed under section 572L, the officer must, in exercising a power conferred on the officer by this Part, have regard to any relevant guidelines in force under subsection (2).  (2) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument, formulate guidelines for the purposes of subsection (1)." ;
    skos:definition "ACMA guidelines  (1) If an authorised infringement notice officer is the Chair of the ACMA, or a member of the staff of the ACMA appointed under section 572L, the officer must, in exercising a power conferred on the officer by this Part, have regard to any relevant guidelines in force under subsection (2).  (2) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument, formulate guidelines for the purposes of subsection (1)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9f2955b8a523c4cb9310453e19e64d9074568a7c8f5ecc0297c7de06b8b84a45" ;
    cof:pageNumber "513"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572m-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-572m-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.513" .
