concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577be a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577BE Effect of approval of draft migration plan"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-577be ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the ACCC approves a draft migration plan, the plan becomes a final migration plan. Note: A final migration plan came into force on 7 March 2012.  (2) If the ACCC approves a draft migration plan under subsection 577BD(2), the plan comes into force at the start of the day after notice of the decision to approve the plan is given to Telstra in accordance with subsection 577BD(6)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the ACCC approves a draft migration plan, the plan becomes a final migration plan. Note: A final migration plan came into force on 7 March 2012.  (2) If the ACCC approves a draft migration plan under subsection 577BD(2), the plan comes into force at the start of the day after notice of the decision to approve the plan is given to Telstra in accordance with subsection 577BD(6)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0d3b6d6c6d45fb13cf03a2d057bf579d8cdc7dcbd869faf32856c58044a767de" ;
    cof:pageNumber "555"^^xsd:integer ;
