concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577e-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577E(6) Acceptance of undertaking about subscription television"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-577e-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of this section, the question of whether Telstra is in a position to exercise control of a subscription television broadcasting licence is to be determined under Schedule 1 to the Broadcasting Services Act 1992." ;
