concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577g-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577G(4) Enforcement of undertakings in force under section 577C or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-577g-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Federal Court may, before making an order under this section, direct that notice of the application be given to such persons as it thinks fit or be published in such manner as it thinks fit, or both." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The Federal Court may, before making an order under this section, direct that notice of the application be given to such persons as it thinks fit or be published in such manner as it thinks fit, or both."@en ;
