concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577g-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577G(5) Enforcement of undertakings in force under section 577C or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-577g-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The Federal Court may, by order, rescind, vary or discharge an order made by it under this section or suspend the operation of such an order." ;
