concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577ga a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577GA Excluded spectrum regime"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-577ga ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that the excluded spectrum regime applies to Telstra.  (2) A determination under subsection (1) has effect for the purposes of:  (a) this Division; and  (b) Part 10 of Schedule 1." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that the excluded spectrum regime applies to Telstra.  (2) A determination under subsection (1) has effect for the purposes of:  (a) this Division; and  (b) Part 10 of Schedule 1."@en ;
