    cof:title "577GA(2) Excluded spectrum regime" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A determination under subsection (1) has effect for the purposes of:  (a) this Division; and  (b) Part 10 of Schedule 1." ;
    cof:pageNumber "578"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577H Designated part of the spectrum"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-577h ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Act, each of the following parts of the spectrum is a designated part of the spectrum:  (a) frequencies higher than 520 MHz, up to and including 820 MHz;  (b) frequencies higher than 2.5 GHz, up to and including 2.69 GHz.  (2) Subsection (1) has effect subject to subsection (3).  (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a specified part of the spectrum is not a designated part of the spectrum for the purposes of this Act.  (4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a specified part of the spectrum is a designated part of the spectrum for the purposes of this Act." ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Act, each of the following parts of the spectrum is a designated part of the spectrum:  (a) frequencies higher than 520 MHz, up to and including 820 MHz;  (b) frequencies higher than 2.5 GHz, up to and including 2.69 GHz.  (2) Subsection (1) has effect subject to subsection (3).  (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a specified part of the spectrum is not a designated part of the spectrum for the purposes of this Act.  (4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a specified part of the spectrum is a designated part of the spectrum for the purposes of this Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bd74f9ac069289967c365987f91eda96a382c9a4c3b0d0da4554590d920cab2e" ;
