concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577k a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577K Limits on use of certain spectrum licences by Telstra"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-577k ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) the excluded spectrum regime applies to Telstra; and  (b) a spectrum licence relates to a designated part of the spectrum; the licensee of the spectrum licence must not authorise Telstra to operate radiocommunications devices under the licence. Note: For excluded spectrum regime, see section 577GA.  (2) However, the rule in subsection (1) does not apply if:  (a) both:  (i) an undertaking given by Telstra is in force under section 577A; and  (ii) the undertaking is covered by subsection (2A); and  (b) either:" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) the excluded spectrum regime applies to Telstra; and  (b) a spectrum licence relates to a designated part of the spectrum; the licensee of the spectrum licence must not authorise Telstra to operate radiocommunications devices under the licence. Note: For excluded spectrum regime, see section 577GA.  (2) However, the rule in subsection (1) does not apply if:  (a) both:  (i) an undertaking given by Telstra is in force under section 577A; and  (ii) the undertaking is covered by subsection (2A); and  (b) either:"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6a6799a6a16a5f1425399da8ec0b3178cebf05ef5b8e9d6fc3cf48c9bf37a710" ;
    cof:pageNumber "581"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577k-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577k-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.581" .
