doc:sec-577m a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "577M Associate" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) For the purposes of this Part, an associate of a designated Telstra successor company in relation to control of:  (a) a telecommunications network; or  (b) a company; is:  (c) a partner of the designated Telstra successor company; or  (d) if the designated Telstra successor company or another person who is an associate of the designated Telstra successor company under another paragraph receives benefits or is capable of benefiting under a trust—the trustee of the trust; or  (e) a person (whether a company or not) who:  (i) acts, or is accustomed to act; or  (ii) under a contract or an arrangement or understanding (whether formal or informal) is intended or expected to act;  in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of, or in concert with:  (iii) the designated Telstra successor company; or  (iv) the designated Telstra successor company and another person who is an associate of the designated Telstra successor company under another paragraph; or  (f) another company if:  (i) the other company is a related body corporate of the designated Telstra successor company for the purposes of the Corporations Act 2001; or" ;
    cof:pageNumber "585"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577n a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577N Control"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-577n ;
    values:originalText "In this Part, control includes control as a result of, or by means of, trusts, agreements, arrangements, understandings and practices, whether or not having legal or equitable force and whether or not based on legal or equitable rights." ;
    skos:definition "In this Part, control includes control as a result of, or by means of, trusts, agreements, arrangements, understandings and practices, whether or not having legal or equitable force and whether or not based on legal or equitable rights."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9e799801377f454748498f614b1b43b8f6c7b5ae7b1343dff8beb9229b64e766" ;
    cof:pageNumber "587"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Definition of control" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
