concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-577p-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577P(2) Control of a company"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-577p-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, in determining that question:  (a) the definition of associate in subsection 6(1) of the Broadcasting Services Act 1992 does not apply; and  (b) the definition of associate in section 577M of this Act applies instead. 577Q  When Telstra or a designated Telstra successor company is in a position to exercise control of a network" ;
    skos:definition "(2) However, in determining that question:  (a) the definition of associate in subsection 6(1) of the Broadcasting Services Act 1992 does not apply; and  (b) the definition of associate in section 577M of this Act applies instead. 577Q  When Telstra or a designated Telstra successor company is in a position to exercise control of a network"@en ;
