doc:sec-579 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "579 Simplified outline" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • The ACMA is to have regard to certain international obligations when performing its telecommunications functions and exercising its telecommunications powers. • The ACMA may give directions to a carrier or a service provider in connection with the ACMA’s performance of its telecommunications functions or the exercise of its telecommunications powers. • The eSafety Commissioner may give directions to a carrier or a service provider in connection with the Commissioner’s performance of his or her functions or the exercise of his or her powers." ;
    cof:pageNumber "591"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-580 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "580 ACMA must have regard to conventions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-580 ;
    values:originalText "(1) In performing its telecommunications functions and exercising its telecommunications powers, the ACMA must have regard to Australia’s obligations under any convention of which the Minister has notified the ACMA in writing.  (2) In this section: convention means:  (a) a convention to which Australia is a party; or  (b) an agreement or arrangement between Australia and a foreign country;" ;
    skos:definition "(1) In performing its telecommunications functions and exercising its telecommunications powers, the ACMA must have regard to Australia’s obligations under any convention of which the Minister has notified the ACMA in writing.  (2) In this section: convention means:  (a) a convention to which Australia is a party; or  (b) an agreement or arrangement between Australia and a foreign country;"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6fc63ffc750a85a67febf725dae21d1cd8489a2727099691afe450aeed65ca9a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "591"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-580-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-580-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
