doc:sec-581f-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "581F(3) Telstra successor company" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a specified company (other than a demerged Telstra company) is a Telstra successor company for the purposes of each prescribed telecommunications law. Note 1: For criteria, see section 581H. Note 2: For specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act 2003." ;
    cof:pageNumber "597"^^xsd:integer .

