concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581pa-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "581PA(6) Notification of proposed transfer of prescribed asset"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-581pa-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) The Minister must not specify a class of assets under subsection (5) unless each asset in the class is, or was, used by a Telstra successor company or a designated Telstra successor company:  (a) in connection with the fulfillment of any of the obligations imposed on the company by or under a telecommunications law; or  (b) in order to maintain the company’s capability (including the technical, operational or organisational capability) to comply with obligations imposed on the company by or under a telecommunications law." ;
    skos:definition "(6) The Minister must not specify a class of assets under subsection (5) unless each asset in the class is, or was, used by a Telstra successor company or a designated Telstra successor company:  (a) in connection with the fulfillment of any of the obligations imposed on the company by or under a telecommunications law; or  (b) in order to maintain the company’s capability (including the technical, operational or organisational capability) to comply with obligations imposed on the company by or under a telecommunications law."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c2d3444e90d7f0a0cab0245d006c14d7aa47d74349f44af51f0d91473d93fb5c" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581pa ;
    cof:pageNumber "608"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Minister must not specify a class of assets without ensuring they were used by a Telstra successor company in connection with telecommunications law obligations." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
