concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581u a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "581U Transitional—references in legislation to Telstra Infraco"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-581u ;
    values:originalText "Limited Scope  (1) This section applies if, as at the commencement of this section, the name of Telstra Corporation Limited (ACN 051 775 556) had not been changed to Telstra Infraco Limited. Transitional  (2) Until the name of Telstra Corporation Limited (ACN 051 775 556) is changed to Telstra Infraco Limited, a reference to Telstra Infraco Limited in a telecommunications law is to be read as a reference to Telstra Corporation Limited.   Access to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part 34B Introduction  Division 1  Section 581V  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "Limited Scope  (1) This section applies if, as at the commencement of this section, the name of Telstra Corporation Limited (ACN 051 775 556) had not been changed to Telstra Infraco Limited. Transitional  (2) Until the name of Telstra Corporation Limited (ACN 051 775 556) is changed to Telstra Infraco Limited, a reference to Telstra Infraco Limited in a telecommunications law is to be read as a reference to Telstra Corporation Limited.   Access to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part 34B Introduction  Division 1  Section 581V  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d0297629a0b11fcbb34eacf441f8ff2e1071533fc2bcf20c134ceb32283dfdd3" ;
