concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581xa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "581XA Deemed bodies corporate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-581xa ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:  (a) a specified person is an individual or a partnership; and  (b) the person owns or operates:  (i) a facility; or  (ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the meaning of Division 3); this Part has effect as if the person were a body corporate that is related to one or more specified bodies corporate.   Access to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part 34B Introduction  Division 1  Section 581XA  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:  (a) a person is the trustee of a specified trust; and  (b) the person (in the capacity of trustee of the trust) owns or operates:  (i) a facility; or  (ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the meaning of Division 3); this Part has effect as if the person (in the capacity of trustee of the trust) were a body corporate that is related to one or more specified bodies corporate.  (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:  (a) 2 or more persons are the trustees of a specified trust; and  (b) the persons (in their capacity of trustees of the trust) own or operate:  (i) a facility; or  (ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the meaning of Division 3); this Part has effect as if the persons (in their capacity of trustees of the trust) were a body corporate that is related to one or more specified bodies corporate." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:  (a) a specified person is an individual or a partnership; and  (b) the person owns or operates:  (i) a facility; or  (ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the meaning of Division 3); this Part has effect as if the person were a body corporate that is related to one or more specified bodies corporate.   Access to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part 34B Introduction  Division 1  Section 581XA  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:  (a) a person is the trustee of a specified trust; and  (b) the person (in the capacity of trustee of the trust) owns or operates:  (i) a facility; or  (ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the meaning of Division 3); this Part has effect as if the person (in the capacity of trustee of the trust) were a body corporate that is related to one or more specified bodies corporate.  (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if:  (a) 2 or more persons are the trustees of a specified trust; and  (b) the persons (in their capacity of trustees of the trust) own or operate:  (i) a facility; or  (ii) a telecommunications transmission tower (within the meaning of Division 3); this Part has effect as if the persons (in their capacity of trustees of the trust) were a body corporate that is related to one or more specified bodies corporate."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a98288843275bfd4bf91b943f1e0c620a84996a8e9b4e2729712c291e55cb9ed" ;
    cof:pageNumber "618"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581xa-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581xa-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581xa-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.618" .
