concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581y-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "581Y(6) Access to supplementary facilities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-581y-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of this section, in determining whether the carrier’s request is reasonable, regard must be had to the question whether compliance with the request will promote the long-term interests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of carriage services. That question is to be determined in the same manner as it is determined for the purposes of Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010." ;
    skos:definition "(6) For the purposes of this section, in determining whether the carrier’s request is reasonable, regard must be had to the question whether compliance with the request will promote the long-term interests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of carriage services. That question is to be determined in the same manner as it is determined for the purposes of Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "abe87c5f5532f91e6ad29a3bcf16c33d0fd81aae4257d7abfcb70176ac1e63e9" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581y ;
    cof:pageNumber "620"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Determine reasonableness of carrier's request based on long-term interests of end-users or services supplied by means of carriage services." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
