    skos:definition "(1) An eligible company must comply with subsection 581Y(1) on such terms and conditions as are:  (a) agreed between the following parties:  (i) the eligible company;  (ii) the carrier concerned; or  (b) failing agreement, determined by an arbitrator appointed by the parties.   Access to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part 34B Access to supplementary facilities  Division 2  Section 581Z  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  If the parties fail to agree on the appointment of an arbitrator, the ACCC is to be the arbitrator."@en ;
