concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581z-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "581Z(3) Terms and conditions of access"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-581z-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular arbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC may be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of members, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or those members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson of the ACCC." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular arbitration conducted by the ACCC under this section, the ACCC may be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of members, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or those members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson of the ACCC."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "85f74b7a90ccd3b9a557573361c608f9807d4b8c54904dfbc415dae75e85dd4e" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581z ;
    cof:pageNumber "622"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The ACCC may be constituted by a single member or specified number of members for a particular arbitration." ;
    dc:description "Nominations in writing by the Chairperson of the ACCC" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
