concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581za a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "581ZA Ministerial pricing determinations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-581za ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination setting out principles dealing with price-related terms and conditions relating to the obligations imposed by subsection 581Y(1). The determination is to be known as a Ministerial pricing determination.  (2) In this section: price-related terms and conditions means terms and conditions relating to price or a method of ascertaining price.   Access to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part 34B Access to telecommunications transmission towers  Division 3  Section 581ZB  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination setting out principles dealing with price-related terms and conditions relating to the obligations imposed by subsection 581Y(1). The determination is to be known as a Ministerial pricing determination.  (2) In this section: price-related terms and conditions means terms and conditions relating to price or a method of ascertaining price.   Access to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part 34B Access to telecommunications transmission towers  Division 3  Section 581ZB  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "09e4c73d06132f9b7eafbbf51bee1249199f3ebe657a50b983c7dff9e94ded81" ;
    cof:pageNumber "624"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581za-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581za-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.624" .
