doc:sec-581zd-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "581ZD(7) Access to telecommunications transmission towers" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) If the ACCC receives a request to make a decision about the issue of a certificate under subsection (4), the ACCC must use its best endeavours to make that decision within 10 business days after the request was made." ;
