    skos:prefLabel "581ZD(9) Access to telecommunications transmission towers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-581zd-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) If, at the time the request was made:  (a) one or more provisions (the contingent provisions) of a contract have not come into force because:" ;
