concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581zf a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "581ZF Code relating to access"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-581zf ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACCC may, by legislative instrument, make a Code setting out conditions that are to be complied with in relation to the provision of access under this Division.  (2) An eligible company must comply with the Code.  (3) This section does not, by implication, limit a power conferred by or under this Act to make an instrument.  (4) This section does not, by implication, limit the matters that may be dealt with by codes or standards referred to in Part 6.  (5) Subsections (3) and (4) do not, by implication, limit subsection 33(3B) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901. 581ZG  This Division does not limit Division 2  This Division does not, by implication, limit Division 2.   Access to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part 34B Review of corporate control percentage  Division 4  Section 581ZH  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACCC may, by legislative instrument, make a Code setting out conditions that are to be complied with in relation to the provision of access under this Division.  (2) An eligible company must comply with the Code.  (3) This section does not, by implication, limit a power conferred by or under this Act to make an instrument.  (4) This section does not, by implication, limit the matters that may be dealt with by codes or standards referred to in Part 6.  (5) Subsections (3) and (4) do not, by implication, limit subsection 33(3B) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901. 581ZG  This Division does not limit Division 2  This Division does not, by implication, limit Division 2.   Access to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part 34B Review of corporate control percentage  Division 4  Section 581ZH  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9ac8278c18b793735378f24134a51fca6c0a3e6abc1fab527bd709f16f4f1b6d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "630"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-581zf-ss-1 ;
