doc:sec-581zf-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "581ZF(5) Code relating to access" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsections (3) and (4) do not, by implication, limit subsection 33(3B) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901. 581ZG  This Division does not limit Division 2  This Division does not, by implication, limit Division 2.   Access to supplementary facilities and telecommunications transmission towers  Part 34B Review of corporate control percentage  Division 4  Section 581ZH  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
