concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-587 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "587 Nomination of address for service of documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-587 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a person may nominate an address for service in:  (a) an application made by the person under this Act; or  (b) any other document given by the person to the ACCC or the ACMA. The address must be in Australia." ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a person may nominate an address for service in:  (a) an application made by the person under this Act; or  (b) any other document given by the person to the ACCC or the ACMA. The address must be in Australia."@en ;
